  <item>
    <title>EP11.朗姆酒：三角贸易的通货，海盗世界的王法|百变酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ec1baa92cfee09e7b6b1c7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ec1baa92cfee09e7b6b1c7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Sep 2024 12:40:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五百多年前，欧洲人通过环球航海把殖民统治带到西半球，甘蔗开始成为遍布美洲大陆最广的种植作物，制糖业成为当地最大的产业。而制糖废料造出来的朗姆酒在随后的日子里征服了新大陆甚至非洲。这一期，我们随着大西洋洋流，来到三角贸易航线和西印度群岛海盗时代，讲述朗姆酒罪恶而传奇的发展历程。也许你想不到，甘香清冽的酒精饮料背后，还隐藏着西方资本原始积累的混乱和残忍。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：困汀&amp;老黑</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Song list：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>NOFX - I Am an Alcoholic</span></p><span></span><p><span>Camila Cabello,Young Thug - Havana</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>The Barman's Bible, Fedor Devsky</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rum: A Global History - Richard Foss</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>网易云/喜马拉雅/小宇宙/蜻蜓FM/豆瓣/苹果Podcast搜索：迷惘FM</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>每期音频和文字也会同步更新在公众号中：迷惘Podcast</span></strong></em></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>商务合作&amp;听众投稿</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>kuntinzz@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loX-uG9mpTWdLusxdrIs8NcTiYx9.m4a" length="47741629" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp99msUYXvqSqqBWKm5qSJv5mIFu.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
