  <item>
    <title>EP10.北境之王伏特加：战斗民族之魂，鸡尾酒之根本|百变酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66da9bdfbfd7110df4a945aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66da9bdfbfd7110df4a945aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Sep 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最常被对瓶吹的烈酒是什么？必然是伏特加。源自东欧，象征着彪悍。便宜清爽让它很快风靡全球，成为最畅销的烈酒。又因为他的中性口味，成为多数鸡尾酒必不可少的基酒。本期咱们来讲讲邻居大熊家的国酒伏特加，再学几款简单的鸡尾酒~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：困汀&amp;老黑</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Song list：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>NOFX - I Am an Alcoholic</span></p><span></span><p><span>本能實業 - John Ле́нин</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>The Barman's Bible, Fedor Devsky</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vodka: History and Production </span><a href="https://www.diageobaracademy.com/en-us/home/alcohol-categories/vodka-history-and-production" data-url="https://www.diageobaracademy.com/en-us/home/alcohol-categories/vodka-history-and-production"><span>www.diageobaracademy.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>A SIDECAR NAMED DESIRE Copyright © 2018 by Greg Clarke and Monte Beauchamp</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>网易云/喜马拉雅/小宇宙/蜻蜓FM/豆瓣/苹果Podcast搜索：迷惘FM</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>每期音频和文字也会同步更新在公众号中：迷惘Podcast</span></strong></em></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>商务合作&amp;听众投稿</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>kuntinzz@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkx2KkkI-G7j0Tu61UmaOnSHCthv.m4a" length="41954581" type="audio/mp4"/>
