  <item>
    <title>EP8.酒客出干邑，不见白兰地—只有白葡萄才地道！| 百变酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c704c47ae3d6d8d262cbb0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c704c47ae3d6d8d262cbb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Aug 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三大洋-轩尼诗、马爹利、人头马，它们究竟什么来头？凭什么那么贵？XO、VSOP，又都代表了什么？你必须知道的“酒中贵族”、“液体黄金”，更是潮人土豪们的炫富法宝。今天一次把白兰地说明白！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：困汀&amp;老黑</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间码：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 白兰地的历史起源及文化发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 干邑白兰地的来源、分类及品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a> 雅文邑白兰地和其它欧洲白兰地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 白兰地的制作工艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 白兰地的饮用讲究和鸡尾酒单</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Song list：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>NOFX - I Am an Alcoholic</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nas - The Message</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>参考书籍：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>Brandy A Global History, Becky Sue Epstein</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Barman's Bible, Fedor Devsky</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>轩尼诗Hennessy X.O Cognac</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFoRQl_i8ct_RfguG9h3wMNt0fp.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>马爹利Martell X.O Cognac</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlHr-5K9-t_N8f6uxtkzxpg7XEYW.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>人头马Remy Martin-路易十三Louis XIII Cognac</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhaNUJ7QdneUzFAsMmQ72XwTmPK1.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>雅文邑的阿尔马涅克蒸馈器</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUkzzJ6dTNkWl5Y7OgElS5DDnNt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>网易云/喜马拉雅/小宇宙/蜻蜓FM/豆瓣/苹果Podcast搜索：迷惘FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>每期音频和文字也会同步更新在公众号中：迷惘Podcast</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>商务合作&amp;听众投稿</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>kuntinzz@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
