  <item>
    <title>EP7.上瘾的辣口剧毒：苦艾酒的湮灭与重生｜百变酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bdfdfcdb5e6d6bf990a1e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bdfdfcdb5e6d6bf990a1e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Aug 2024 13:09:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>苦艾酒一直是酒精饮料中的异类。从无数艺术家追捧的“绿色仙子”，到人人喊打的“魔鬼毒药”，它究竟经历了什么。本期我们就来讲讲苦艾酒的故事和喝法，愿你喝完也能看到梵高眼中的星空~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：困汀&amp;老黑</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间码：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 苦艾酒的制作工艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 苦艾酒的历史和背后一系列故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> 苦艾酒的品牌/产品推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 苦艾酒的不同喝法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 苦艾酒的鸡尾酒单</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Song list：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>NOFX - I Am an Alcoholic</span></p><span></span><p><span>Marilyn Manson - Sweet Dreams (Are made of This)</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>参考书籍：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>Hideous Absinthe A History of the Devil in a Bottle, Jad Adams</span></p><span></span><p><span>A Taste for Absinthe 65 Recipes for Classic and Contemporary Cocktails, R. Winston Guthrie, James F. Thompson etc.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Absinthe - Wikipedia</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>爱德华·马奈《喝苦艾酒的人》</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmcrzYYG7G6mULO1QZr_w6Et98WD.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>埃德加•德加《苦艾酒》</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtcZltQ-KzZzbNqxNPHxHCNJMltF.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>毕加索《喝苦艾酒的人》</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkx9Wv8VFtXYRqDPjN0PndLtWPfo.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>梵·高《星空》</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luJRb_Xod-rGmE6mC6rc2fMJcs8h.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>梵·高《苦艾酒杯》</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlAviCwPmlHClwsGS_iuw0o8FwEv.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>瑞士一幅关于取缔苦艾酒的海报</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuw3XwHRiDknRsCnwBN9Fh-Vji7K.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>绿魔苦艾酒</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNu69dbLKX2dE4swjLgGFNaeJnN.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>曼森苦艾酒</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvskh_zPQoSefruak1vw-fvwGI_H.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>糜苦艾酒</span></em></blockquote><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL21tYml6X2pwZy9KUXZiM1JHWWp5OFVaU2liWXQ0QmlhVWh2MDNtQ2ZCd09tUGdTc0JZT2xNdE9BU1FJTERhendrdWs5Tlg5Z0pSRmhTbXhSbFdQWVpreFY3VW5yT1JnSGtBLzY0MD93eF9mbXQ9anBlZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>苦艾酒匙</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjvtC8v94sj5UHwQArbTF0TgxBgO.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>苦艾酒泉</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fss832odFYvFFVdIqEbHHId-YkQ0.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><em><span>苦艾酒杯</span></em></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghV0F-O6xNpOO8zqxt_IUAm32tD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>网易云/喜马拉雅/小宇宙/蜻蜓FM/豆瓣/苹果Podcast搜索：迷惘FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>每期音频和文字也会同步更新在公众号中：迷惘Podcast</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>商务合作&amp;听众投稿</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>kuntinzz@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
