  <item>
    <title>EP6.巴黎奥运会观众指定饮料：法国葡萄酒 | 百变酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b5d6c533591c27bee2d958</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b5d6c533591c27bee2d958</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
