    <title>EP5.你喝的是大绿棒子，我喝的才是精酿啤酒！| 百变酒精</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a8d5b07349f7a55799a5ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a8d5b07349f7a55799a5ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 11:59:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最常喝的大绿棒子，原来仅是120多种啤酒中的一种？本期我们就来聊聊世界第三大饮料—啤酒。讲讲啤酒的文化历史和种类，以及精酿啤酒和工业啤酒到底有啥不同？听完这期，你就是朋友圈的啤酒专家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：困汀&amp;老黑</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间码：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 关于啤酒的个人记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 啤酒的历史起源&amp;文化发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 嬉皮士与美国现代精酿运动&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 啤酒的制作工艺：拉格&amp;艾尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 科普精酿啤酒&amp;工业啤酒的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 市面常见“伪精酿”避雷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 啤酒的分类：讲讲常见的四种啤酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2144">35:44</a> 个人向推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2396">39:56</a> 喝精酿啤酒的讲究 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Song list：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>NOFX - I Am an Alcoholic</span></p><span></span><p><span>钢心 - 龙王</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>参考书籍：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>BJCP(啤酒品酒师资格认证协会) -《世界啤酒分类指南》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>啤酒的制作工艺</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQfZMxZwmUfJYkgoSfvKe7z4B0-.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>啤酒大家族</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnSUUha24J98T9N6SHVf3TqHDXG0.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>罗斯福10号</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQj0N0mAZ-xvc5xqiOj0V_1BBHn.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>智美蓝帽</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrsOve2y9